.Pp
.Sh BUGS
The library is not thread safe, meaning calls to functions, especially parsing
functions, should be serialized.
.Pp
While it is possible to use the functions intended to create JSON to add to
JSON that was parsed from a file or a buffer, this functionality has not been
extensively tested. Use with caution.
.Pp
There is no means to selectively delete JSON from the internal representation,
and selective copying needs to be done, instead.
